  "question": {
    "text": "A vessel contains <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of hydrogen and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>128</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of oxygen at standard temperature and pressure. The volume of the vessel in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cm</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math> is :"
  },
